1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,154
PACT. The payment authorization gateway for AI agents.

2
00:00:04,154 --> 00:00:08,407
Let any agent shop for you, only within the limits you set.

3
00:00:09,133 --> 00:00:11,071
AI agents can now shop for us.

4
00:00:11,071 --> 00:00:13,876
But to pay, we hand them a card with no limits.

5
00:00:13,876 --> 00:00:15,304
One injected prompt,

6
00:00:15,304 --> 00:00:18,359
and real money moves before anyone approves it.

7
00:00:18,817 --> 00:00:21,910
PACT sits between any AI agent and PayPal.

8
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:23,643
Agents can only ask.

9
00:00:23,643 --> 00:00:26,674
A deterministic policy engine authorizes,

10
00:00:26,674 --> 00:00:29,771
a human approves, and PayPal executes.

11
00:00:30,133 --> 00:00:31,588
Set your rules once.

12
00:00:31,588 --> 00:00:34,602
This mandate allows desk tech from five retailers,

13
00:00:34,602 --> 00:00:38,125
and lets PACT authorize anything up to $100 on its own.

14
00:00:38,483 --> 00:00:40,470
An agent asks for a mouse.

15
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:44,792
Channel3 searches real retailers, Gemini picks the cheapest offer,

16
00:00:44,792 --> 00:00:48,473
and every rule passes, so PACT authorizes it by itself.

17
00:00:48,473 --> 00:00:50,241
No approval click.

18
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,156
PACT creates a real PayPal Sandbox order,

19
00:00:53,156 --> 00:00:56,171
and the buyer approves it in PayPal Checkout.

20
00:00:56,517 --> 00:01:00,308
The moment PayPal confirms, PACT captures automatically:

21
00:01:00,308 --> 00:01:03,804
a real capture ID, completed, for the exact amount.

22
00:01:03,804 --> 00:01:06,957
Then the buyer continues to the retailer.

23
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,842
A $109.99 keyboard passes every rule too,

24
00:01:09,842 --> 00:01:11,865
but it is above the auto limit.

25
00:01:11,865 --> 00:01:13,473
So PACT stops and asks,

26
00:01:13,473 --> 00:01:16,473
and my approval is sealed with a fingerprint.

27
00:01:16,816 --> 00:01:20,147
A SHA-256 hash of the product, merchant, price,

28
00:01:20,147 --> 00:01:23,358
quantity, mandate rules and requesting agent.

29
00:01:23,358 --> 00:01:25,599
A forged approval is refused,

30
00:01:25,599 --> 00:01:29,665
and the hash is checked again before every PayPal step.

31
00:01:29,999 --> 00:01:32,667
And a retailer I never allowed is simply blocked.

32
00:01:32,667 --> 00:01:35,258
There is no approve button to override it.

33
00:01:35,616 --> 00:01:38,358
Connecting an outside agent takes seconds.

34
00:01:38,358 --> 00:01:40,770
It gets one mandate and its own key,

35
00:01:40,770 --> 00:01:43,487
shown once and stored only as a hash.

36
00:01:43,833 --> 00:01:46,859
Claude, ChatGPT or your own agent

37
00:01:46,859 --> 00:01:49,590
use PACT's API or MCP server.

38
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:51,952
Told money is no object,

39
00:01:51,952 --> 00:01:55,302
this Gemini agent still gets a no.

40
00:01:55,649 --> 00:01:58,702
Every decision is audited and charted with AG Studio.

41
00:01:58,702 --> 00:02:01,254
Its own AI agents can analyze the spending,

42
00:02:01,254 --> 00:02:03,605
but they can never approve or pay.

43
00:02:03,966 --> 00:02:07,487
Any platform plugs in with one connector that returns offers.

44
00:02:07,487 --> 00:02:09,631
The policy engine, the fingerprint

45
00:02:09,631 --> 00:02:11,973
and the PayPal flow never change.

46
00:02:12,449 --> 00:02:15,895
Agents request. The policy engine authorizes.

47
00:02:15,895 --> 00:02:18,626
A human approves. PayPal executes.

48
00:02:18,626 --> 00:02:22,906
PACT. The payment authorization gateway for AI agents.
